{"id":"11ebf1bb0700","publishedAt":1795414513000,"posts":[[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/8/4/84d5d8b1.jpg"}],[{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\nソシャゲのメインヒロインがマッドシティ出身なのはじめてみた"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/1/0/1049e128.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"《📢全キャラクター公開☀️》"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"『雨のちハレ女』に登場する"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"メインキャラクターを公開しました！"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"北海道、東京、京都、沖縄、イギリスの"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"ハレ女とクモリンが日本中で活躍します。"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"各プロフィールや写真はこちら👇️"},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"href":"https://t.co/hjG74mDf7r","text":"https://t.co/hjG74mDf7r"},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"href":"https://x.com/hashtag/%E3%83%8F%E3%83%AC%E5%A5%B3?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"#ハレ女"},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"href":"https://t.co/ReJQw9RT38","text":"pic.twitter.com/ReJQw9RT38"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"— 『雨のちハレ女』公式アカウント (@hareonna_info) "},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"href":"https://x.com/hareonna_info/status/2123702917441978747?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"2026年11月20日"}],[{"color":"rgb(219, 0, 0)","size":23,"bold":true,"text":"\nすげぇ"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(219, 0, 0)","size":23,"bold":true,"text":"\n紹介文の半分がバカだ"}],[{"color":"rgb(240, 98, 2)","size":23,"bold":true,"text":"\n🌀"},{"color":"rgb(240, 98, 2)","size":23,"bold":true,"text":"<ﾋｨｨｨｨｨｨ<br>"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\nカレーフェスもカレーフェスで台風予報出てるなら中止しとけよ！？"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>51"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\nあの子ならきっときてくれるってカレーフェス側も分かっているんだろう"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n気象兵器じゃん"}],[{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\n>>4"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\nこいつが一番やばいと思う"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/d/3/d39fb7b2.jpg"}],[{"color":"rgb(247, 70, 158)","size":23,"bold":true,"text":"\n>>7"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(247, 70, 158)","size":23,"bold":true,"text":"\n干上がったダムを一日で満杯に！？"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>7"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\n相模ダムが干上がることがいちばんやばいだろ"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>52"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\nたぶん晴れ属性のキャラのせい"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>7"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\n敵対するって言ってるけどPVの時点でもうデレそうな雰囲気凄い"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>7"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\nスレ画と出会ったらどうなるの…"}],[{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\n表情集がこれ"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/2/3/23eb0bbe.jpg"}],[{"color":"rgb(247, 70, 158)","size":23,"bold":true,"text":"\n眉毛ふといね❤️"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\nその二人が同じ場所に行くと天気はどうなる"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>11"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\n勝ったほうが我々の敵になるだけです"}],[{"color":"rgb(181, 12, 205)","bold":true,"text":"\n一介の人間が持ってちゃいけない異能だろこれ"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>15"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\nちょっと強力な晴女雨女なだけだけど…"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\nちなみにイギリスはこうなってる"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/d/3/d3189888.jpg"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>16"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\n……フッ。"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>50"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\n表情集これだけら絶対変な女だという確信がある"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/9/a/9ada6014.jpg"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\nふーんて感じで告知見てたけど馬鹿すぎる人物紹介で段々気になってきた"}],[{"color":"rgb(240, 98, 2)","bold":true,"text":"\n行った場所の気温50℃くらい上げるデスバレーちゃんとかもいるの？"}],[{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\n>>21"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\n沖縄の晴れ女　\n"},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/6/1/61ff9a29.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\nイギリス　\n"},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/a/c/ac693015.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\n北海道　\n"},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/8/a/8a3d35e2.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\n京都　\n"},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/6/1/61658d8d.jpg"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>26"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\n和歌山じゃねーか"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>26"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\n和歌山みたいな田舎にアイドルなんかいねぇだろ"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>235"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\nM!LKに和歌山市出身おるけど？"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>235"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\nアニメヒロイン名産地だぞ！"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\nこのトンデモお天気女たちでどんな話を作るつもりなの"}],[{"color":"rgb(247, 70, 158)","size":23,"bold":true,"text":"\nグラードンとカイオーガかよ"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n京都でギャル珍しいなと思ったら和歌山じゃねえか"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>27"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\n京都の学校は他のメンバーも長野県飯島町と大阪府堺市出身"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\nひでりとあめふらしだけじゃバランス悪いだろ"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\nすなおこしとゆきふらしのヒロインも入れろ"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\n主人公はてんきやにしろ"}],[{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\n>>34"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\nゆきふらしは居る"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/goldennews/imgs/c/0/c0c30b72.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(52, 44, 222)","bold":true,"text":"\nすなおこしは…まぁそのうち黄砂使いが出てくるんじゃねえかな…"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>40"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"\nアシリパさんじゃん…"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\nなんてストーリー作りづらそうな設定だ"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\nオミットできるんですよね…？"}],[{"color":"rgb(181, 12, 205)","bold":true,"text":"\n学マスのキャラデザでも思ったけど南野アキやはりいいキャラデザする…"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n雷属性は？"}],[{"bold":true,"text":"\n>>43"}]],"comments":["なんかわかんねえけどとりあえずキャラがかわいすぎるだろ","いぶきﾏﾏｧ","お、お前…変な薬でもやってるのか"]}